I understand that he gets a
lot of fulfillment out of it,

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.084
but at the same time, he's
so stressed out all the time.

00:00:13.084 --> 00:00:15.162
- Hey, can I sniff your butt?

00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:16.608
- Yeah.

00:00:18.178 --> 00:00:20.153
