00:00:20.153 --> 00:00:21.411
- Cool.

00:00:21.411 --> 00:00:25.028
- Hey, hey, hey, that's my pole!

00:00:25.028 --> 00:00:27.169
Okay, I guess it's your pole now.

00:00:27.169 --> 00:00:28.423
Hey!

00:00:28.423 --> 00:00:30.106
Hey, Henry!

00:00:30.106 --> 00:00:31.536
Hey!

